OL,3,GNEWSA'Room for improvement' on offer of
OL,4,Aextra #1.5bn for NI, says O'Dowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is "room for improvement" on the
OL,7,FUK government's offer of an extra
OL,8,F#1.5bn for Northern Ireland, Finance
OL,9,FMinister John O'Dowd has said.
OL,11,FHe was speaking after an urgent meeting
OL,12,Fof Stormont ministers on Tuesday in
OL,13,Fwhich they had a "useful discussion"
OL,14,Fabout the latest offer.
OL,16,FNo budget has been agreed by the
OL,17,Fpower-sharing coalition six months into
OL,18,Fthe financial year, with Stormont
OL,19,Fparties pressing Westminster for more
OL,20,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
