OL,3,GNEWSA'Room for improvement' on offer of
OL,4,Aextra #1.5bn for NI, says O'Dowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant made a "final offer" of #1.5bn
OL,8,Fextra money last month and has since
OL,9,Finstructed his officials to consider
OL,10,F"contingency plans" should it not be
OL,11,Faccepted.
